{"id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Compact Subset","display":"df-zfc-top2-compact-subset — ZFC Top2 Compact Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-compact-subset — ZFC Top2 Compact Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-compact-subset — ZFC Top2 Compact Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,K\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land K\\subseteq X\\land \\forall\\mathcal U\\;\\bigl((\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\land K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\to \\exists\\mathcal V\\;(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land \\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal V)\\land K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land K\\subseteq X\\land \\forall\\mathcal U\\;\\bigl((\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\land K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\to \\exists\\mathcal V\\;(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land \\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal V)\\land K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Zf